## Windsurf-Specific Corrections (from previous incorrect rules)

className IS allowed on wrappers with Lens utilities (not forbidden).
CSS modules ARE allowed for wrappers with var(--lns-*) (not forbidden).
Numbers ARE valid where Lens supports them: maxWidth={40} padding={2}.
style={{}} is the only absolute styling prohibition.

