## Key API Differences

| Wrong | Correct |
|-------|---------|
| Box div | Container |
| Flex display:flex | Split |
| Grid display:grid | Arrange |
| h1 p span | Text + htmlTag |
| disabled loading | isDisabled hasLoader |
| as="a" | htmlTag="a" |
| ref={ref} | refHandler={(r) => ref.current = r} |
| leftIcon rightIcon | iconBefore iconAfter |
| size="small/medium/large" on Text | body-sm body-md body-lg |